  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global energy districts programme # Morocco interventions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GEDP Morocco is intended to constitute the foundational phase of a multi-year, multi-stage Morocco ED/RE-ED Programme, aiming to pro gressively create a functioning Moroccan ED/RE-ED market by demonstrating viable pilots, strengthening institutional and regulatory capacities, and enabling systematic replication and scale-up across priority urban and industrial districts. The intervention will strengthen institutional and policy frameworks, build technical and financial capacities across the ED/RE-ED value chain, and enhance national knowledge systems and partnerships, thereby creating the enabling conditions for the effective development, uptake and r eplication of ED/RE-ED projects, while also demonstrating whether sufficient traction exists (government support, public/private interest, investment climate and socio-economic benefits) to move to a second phase.</narrative>
  </description>
